/**
 * A prop read only through an alias of the props object (`const p = props`,
 * `const q = p`; `q.n` in a handler) is still a use of that prop: it is
 * serialized for hydration and the handler reads the caller-supplied value.
 * The client reference graph counts a member read through the props object or
 * through a component constant that aliases it, from the facts the analyzer
 * recorded for the handler text.
 *
 * Snapshots in `__snapshots__/props-alias-handler-hydrate.{html,client.js}`
 * are regenerated by
 * `bun run packages/adapter-tests/scripts/snapshot.ts props-alias-handler-hydrate`.
 */

